<h2>About</h2>
<p>In astrophysics, the three-body problem asks to predict the exact motion of three planets orbiting each other in space. Famously, this problem is too chaotic to be solved analytically or with computers, unlike the simpler two-body problem</p>

<p>Mizaru, Kikazaru, and Imazaru are three brothers who think about things, talk about things, and write about things.</p>

<!-- Authors come from src/_data/authors.json. Photos go in src/pictures/. -->
<section class="authors">
  {%- for id, a in authors %}
  {#- The whole card links to this author's posts in the Archive #}
  <a class="author" id="{{ id }}" href="/archive/?author={{ id }}">
    <div class="avatar"><img src="{{ a.photo }}" alt=""></div>
    <h3>{{ a.name }}</h3>
    <p>{{ a.bio }}</p>
  </a>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>
